   "summary": "This section comprises statistical tables and the roster of educational institutions for Ibaraki Prefecture compiled in 1946. It includes summary tables of private schools and schools under other Japanese government ministries, followed by Part Three's detailed institutional roster of national, prefectural, municipal, and town/village schools. Entries record each school's name, type, location, date of establishment, and enrollment and teacher counts (male, female, and part-time) as of April 30 and November 30, 1946.",
